<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Showscan plans Australian expansion.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Showscan plans Australian expansion.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S.-based entertainment group Showscan Entertainment Inc said on Wednesday it plans to enter the giant-screen theatre market in Australia.</p>
<p>Showscan said the move follows a successful ruling against court action taken by rival giant-screen cinema operator Imax Corp of Canada.</p>
<p>It said senior Showscan management will arrive in Australia on Thursday to begin discussion with government agencies and major industry players.</p>
</text>
